  "question": "What attraction exist within a 90 kilometers range as I move toward Sculpture Plaza, Mountain View, CA from Strawberry Hill, San Francisco, CA?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-122.475512 37.768668)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-122.078458 37.420875)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE tourism = 'attraction'\nAND ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-122.475512 37.768668)',4326)::geography, 90000)\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-122.475512 37.768668)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5);\n",
